<title>POLAND: Polish shares end mixed in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares end mixed in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six stocks rose, three fell and six were flat in 4.3-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Thursday.</p>
<p>The remaining six stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units were down in a 9.1-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
